    {
     "type": "text",
     "md": "**Petit texte : My town**\n\nI live in a small town. There is a big market and two schools. The market is next to the bus station. On Saturday, my mother buys plantains and tomatoes at the market. I like my town because my friends live there."
    },
    {
     "type": "audio",
     "text": "I live in a small town. There is a big market and two schools. The market is next to the bus station.",
     "lang": "en-GB"
    },
    {
     "type": "example",
     "title": "Exemple 1 : lire un texte",
     "statement": "D'après le texte, où est le marché ?",
     "steps": [
      {
       "md": "On cherche la phrase avec **market**."
      },
      {
       "md": "« The market is **next to** the bus station. »"
      },
      {
       "md": "Next to veut dire à côté de."
      }
     ],
     "answer": "**Le marché est à côté de la gare routière.**"
    },
    {
     "type": "example",
     "title": "Exemple 2 : écrire une phrase",
     "statement": "Écris en anglais : « Il y a un hôpital près de l'école. »",
     "steps": [
      {
       "md": "Il y a = **there is** (un seul hôpital)."
      },
      {
       "md": "Près de = **near**."
      },
      {
       "md": "*There is a hospital near the school.*"
      }
     ],
     "answer": "**There is a hospital near the school.**"
    },
